          }
        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:3183.278076171875,352.2987976074219,634.2041015625,4056.621612548828",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\nAnd if, out of your favor, [you could send] a small quantity of fine [...]\n</li>\n<li>\nat whatever price, even if it were five ra\u1e6dls\n</li>\n<li>\nfor half a dinar, may I never be deprived of it nor left without it.\n</li>\n<li>\nAll of this is only because of my familiarity\n</li>\n<li>\nwith your generosity.\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
